<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">1Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu ua kulivanga kuli vaka Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu ua kulivanga kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda uakulivanga ku vaka Tesalonika vausonekele kuli Kanganda Paulu. Uasa kupua mukanda uakulivanga uje Paulu uasonekele kupua mbazuvuila ya Mbimbiliya kaha uausonekele kusetekesa ha miaka makumi atanu naumo (51) hanima ya kusemuka kua Kilistu. Paulu uakele mu Kolinte mukemo muasonekelele mukanda uaku cikungulukilo caku Tesalonika, cikungulukilo caputukile ha vungenzi vuendi vua mucivali vua kutuala muzimbu uacili ua Njambi (Vilinga 17: 1-10). Mu Livulu lia Vilinga lihandeka ngualio mu cikungulukilo muakele Vayunda na Vangelengu. Paulu kasele kutumama ntsimbu ya ilaha mu Tesalonika, hanima ya kuputuka cikungulukilo, kaha uatumine ou mukanda mu kutakamesa vaka kutsiliela kuje. Mukanda ou uli na mitue yaingi hamo na vishika vije muvanapandele kuyoya vaka Yesu. Paulu alina kuhaka mana cikuma ha kuija kua Kilistu lua mucivali. Nankuma, vaka kutsiliela vaku Tesalonika vavuahelele ha mutue ou. Paulu ualikuasesele kuija kua Kilistu lua mucivali linga vayoye vuyoye vuje vuvuahelesa Njambi (5: 6-8)</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvanautumbikilamo:</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu aputuka mu mukanda ou na kumeneka cikungulukilo na kutsantsela Njambi hali vakevo (1).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaha alumbununa ha vilinga na muzimbu uje uanehele Timateo (2-3).</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakuhatako Paulu ahana vishika mu vanapandela kuyoyelamo vaka Yesu mu ceke hakuija kua Yesu lua mucivali (4: 1-5, 15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu amanusula mukumeneka cikungulukilo naua na kuvalomba linga voshe vautande mukanda (5: 16-28)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Mukanda ua kuhuma kuli Paulu na Siluvanasi na Timateo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Ku vantu va cikungulukilo ca mu Tesalonika, vaje vanakundama kuli Njambi Tate na Muene Yesu Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale neni.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Ahana Citsatselo kuli Njambi ha Muono na Lutsilielo lua vaka Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Ntsimbu yoshe tukatsantsela kuli Njambi hali yeni voshe, kaha naua ntsimbu yoshe tukamilombelela. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Tukanuka ku mesho a Njambi yetu na Tatetu muje mumunahaka lutsilielo lueni mu vipangi, na muje cizango ceni cili nakumihundanganesa, na muje kutsiliela kueni mukukola ngo muli Muene yetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Vamuanetu, tuatantekeya nguetu Njambi ua mizanga naua namihangula kupua mu vendi, <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>omuo tuaminehelele Muzimbu Uacili, keti na mezi lika, vuno honi na nzili na Cimbembesi Uakulela, kaha na lukakateya lua vusunga vuavio. Muatantekeya muje vati tuayoyele omo tuakele hamo neni, eci capuile ngeci omuo yeni. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Muatembunuisile yetu na Muene, kaha cipue vene muayandele cikuma, vuno honi muatambuile muzimbu na nzolela ije ikahumu kuli Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Nankuma, yeni muapuile cimueso kuli voshe vaka kutsiliela mu Masendoniya na mu Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Omuo keti lika nge lizi lia Muene liahumine kuli yeni mu Masendoniya na mu Akaya kuahi, vuno honi muzimbu ua lutsilielo lueni kuli Njambi unashandokela kuoshe. Nankuma, nacimo cahi cituasa kuhandeka. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Vantu va kucihela kuje vakele nakuhandeka muje vati yeni muatutambuile omo tuezile nakumimona, kaha naua na vati muje muatengulukile kuhuma ku tumponia nakuija kuli Njambi, nakupangela Njambi ua vusunga uakuyoya, <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>nakuvandamena Munendi omo akeja kuhuma muilu, Munendi Yesu, uje yasanguile ku vatsi, naua ikeye uje akatupatula ku vutenu vua Njambi vuje vulinakuija.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Vipangi via Paulu mu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Omo Yeni vavenia Vamuanetu muatantekeya ngueni nkuma kumeneka kuetu kuli yeni kukuapuile kuangoco. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Muatantekeya vati muje vatuyandesele nakutushaula mu Filipu ntsimbu kanda tuije kuli yeni mu Tesalonika. Kaha cipue vene kuakele kutuluisa kuakama, Njambi yetu uatutakamesele mukumiambuluila Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Kulomba kuetu kuli yeni kukuemanene ha vutumbe vuakusevuisa cipue ha matumbe a mapi, cipue kukuisa muntu umo. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Vuno honi vintsimbu vioshe tulinakuhandeka nge muje Njambi atonda linga tulinge, omuo natutavesa yetu ngeci catupande kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili. Kututondo kueseka kuvuahelesa vantu, vuno honi kuvuahelesa Njambi, uje muka kueseka mitima yetu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Muatantekeya muacili ngueni kutuezile kuli yeni mukuhandeka viakuzembeleka, cipue kulikuasesa mezi akumifuikafuika cipululu, Njambi ikeye mukaleho uetu! <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Kutuatondele linga vatushangazale kuli muntu umo kuahi, cipue kuli yeni cipue kuli veka, cipue vene nge tunganda va Kilistu nge tuasele kumihana citele. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Vuno honi tuakele na ngozi omo tuakele neni hamo, nge cisemi ua mpuevo omo alinakulela vana vendi. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Omuo ha cizango cetu kuli yeni, tualivuaheselele linga tulipangezele neni hamo keti lika Muzimbu Uacili uakuhuma kuli Njambi vuno honi na miono yetu naua. Omuo yeni muapuile vaje vatuazanga cikuma! <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Muavusunga vene anukeni vamuanetu, vati muje tuapangele nakuhundangana! Tuapangele vutsiki na mutania linga keti tupue citele kuli yeni te mutuambuluile kuli yeni Muzimbu Uacili ua Njambi.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Yeni munapu vakaleho vetu, na Njambi naua, linga mu miono yetu ku mesho eni vaka kutsiliela yapuile yakulela, ya vusunga nakuhona mulonga. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Muatantekeya ngueni yetu tuapangesele umo na umo ueni nge visemi vapangesa vana vavo vavenia. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Tuamitakamesele, tuamizembelekele nakumisindiya linga muyoye yoyesi ije ivuahelesa Njambi, uje alinakumisana linga mulipangezele hamo Vumuene vuendi vavenia na vumpau.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Naua kuli cuma cikuavo omuo vika ntsimbu yoshe tukatsatsela kuli Njambi. Omo tuaminehelele lizi lia Njambi, yeni mualiuvuile nakulitambula, keti nge lizi liakuhuma ku vantu vuno honi nge lizi lia Njambi, lije linapu lizi lia Njambi vene. Omuo Njambi alinakupanga hhakati keni vaje vanatsiliela. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Vamuanetu, yeni muatembunusuile vikungulukilo via Njambi mu Yundeya, vije vili muli Yesu Kilistu. Muayandele na mapakeso akuhuma ku vantu veni nge muje Vayunda muvayandeselele vikungulukilo, <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>vaje vatsihile Muene Yesu na tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi, nakutupakesa yetu. Vakevo kuvekuvuahelesa Njambi! Vapua vitozi kuli vantu voshe! <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Vesekele kutuvindika kuambulula lizi kuli vaje keti Vayunda linga na vakevo vatambule kuovoka. Mu ngila eyi vene vakevo vanashulisa vene seteko ya vipi vije vivalingile ntsimbu yoshe, Kaha honi vutenu vua Njambi hakukotoka vuneja hali vakevo!<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kushunguiya kua Paulu kuakumimenekela naua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Nge hali yetu, vamuanetu, omo tualihangunukile neni mu kantsimbu kakandende lika, keti mu viyongola vietu kuahi, vuno honi ku muvila uatsitu lika, tuamihonene kaha tuahundanganene na kueseka kumimona naua! <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Tuatondele kuhiluka kuli yeni. Yange vene Paulu njesekele cikuma kuhiluka lualuingi vuno honi Satana katutavesele. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Nankuma, hangavene munapu yeni, keti veka kuahi, vaje vanapu kutsiliela kuetu na nzolela yetu na cilongo cije tukalihalesa ha kuhiana ku mesho a Muene Yesu omo akeja. <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Cilivene, yeni munapu kulihalesa kuetu na nzolela yetu!<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Hakumanusuila, omuo kutuasele kutualelelaho kulinga cili coshe ha kumimona, kaha tuayonguele linga vatuseze mu Atena likalietu lika. <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Te tunatumu Timateo, muanetu uje muka kupanga netu mu vipangi via Njambi mu kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu. Tuamutumine mukumitakamesa nakumikolesa ha lutsilielo lueni, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>linga naumo uahi ua hali yeni akahiluke munima omuo ha mapakeso aua. Yeni vavenia muatantekeya ngueni mapakeso aua anapu aku cizango ca Njambi hali yetu. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Te ha ntsimbu ije tuakele hamo neni, tuamilekelele vualumo nguetu tukauana mapakeso, nge mumuatantekeyela, evi vikevio cilivene vialingiuile. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Eci cikeco cinjatuminine Timateo. Omuo kunjasele kutualelelaho naua, nankuma, njamutumine linga akumone vati lutsilielo lueni mulunapu. Muavusunga vene kucapuile nge Satana namieseka, kaha nge vipangi vietu vioshe viapuile viangoco!<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muzimbu ua Kusimpisa kuhuma kuli Timateo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Vuno honi Timateo nahiluka kuno, kaha natuleka muzimbu uacili ha lutsilielo lueni na cizango ceni. Natuleka nguendi ntsimbu yoshe mulinakutuanuka, kaha mulinakutonda kutumona nge naua muje yetu tulinakutonda kumimona. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Omuo ha cuma eci, mu makalu etu oshe na tuyando tuetu, tuakele nakulitakamesa omuo hali yeni vamuanetu. Lutsilielo lueni lukeluo luatutakamesele, <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Honi tuyoya nga yeni muimana ngoo mu vuyoye vueni muli Muene. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Honi tuhonoua vati kutsatsela Njambi cikuma omuo yeni. Tulinakumutsatsela ha nzolela ije tulinayo ku mesho endi omuo yeni. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Vutsiki na mutania tulinakumulomba na mitima yetu yoshe linga atutave kumimona mesho na mesho nakumihana vije vimunahonoua mu lutsilielo lueni.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Honi Njambi yetu na Tatetu na Muene yetu Yesu Kilistu vatuvuahesele ngila linga tuije nakumimona! <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Honi Muene akolese cizango ceni kuli umo na mukuavo na kuli vantu voshe nakucipuisa cakama nge cizango cetu kuli yeni. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Mu ngila eyi vene akatakamesa mitima yeni, kaha mukapua vakulamba na kulela ku mesho a Njambi yetu na Tatetu omo Muene yetu Yesu akeja na voshe vaka kulela vendi.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Vuyoye vuje vuvuahelelesa Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Mukumanusuila, vamuanetu, tumilomba nakumisindiya muli Muene Yesu, nguetu nge muje mumualilongesele kuli yetu vati munapande kuyoya linga muvuahelese Njambi. Nge muje mumuli nakulinga. Lingeni muje vene nakuvuezelelaho cikuma. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Omuo muatantekeya vishika vituamihanene kuhitila mu nzili yakama ya Muene Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Njambi atonda linga mupue vakulela nakupatuka ku vukoyi. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Muntu na muntu kuli yeni vamala atantekeye vati napande kuyoya na mpueyendi mu ngila yakulela nakasingimiko, <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>keti na vukoyi, ngue vakakuhona kutsiliela vaje kuvatantekeya Njambi. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Mucifua eci vene, naumo uahi ueni napande kulinga muamupi kuli vakuavo vaka Yesu cipue kuvazangamena. Tuaminanguile laja cuma eci, kaha tuaminanguile na nzili nguetu Muene akahana kashitiku kuli vaje vakalingi evi. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Njambi katusanene linga tuyoye mu vukoyi, vuno honi mu kulela. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Nankuma, uoshe uje aviana vilongesa evi kaviana muntu, vuno honi Njambi, uje akamihana Cimbembesi uendi Uakulela.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Kutuapandele kumisonekela via cizango kuli umo na mukuavo. Omuo yeni vavenia Njambi uamilongesele vati muje munapande kulizanga umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Kaha munakala nakulinga ngeci kuli vaka kutsiliela voshe mu Masendonia muoshe. Nankuma, tumilomba vakuetu, vuezeleleniko cikuma. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Pueni vaka kuyoya mukuholoka, hakeni mana eni ku viuma vieni, nakupanga viakulikuasa navio yeni vavenia, nge muje tuamilekele laja. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Mu ngila eyi vene, mukatambula kasingimiko kuli vaje keti vaka kutsiliela, kaha kumukayoyela muntu umo kuli vije munahonoua.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija kua Muene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Vamuanetu, tutonda mutantekeye vusunga hali vaje vanatsi, linga keti mukale navusiua, nge vaje kuvesi nakutsiliela. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Omuo tunatsiliela nguetu Yesu uatsile, kaha uasangukile naua, kaha tunatsiliela nguetu Njambi akaneha hamo na Yesu vaje vatsile mukutsiliela kuli ikeye.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Evi tumilongesa hano vinapu vilongesa via Muene linga yetu vaje vacili nakuyoya ha litangua lije Munendi akeja kutukatuama kulutue lua vaje vanatsi. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Kukakala mutambi ua lizi liakama liakushika, lizi lia kangelo uakama, nakuohia kua tolombita ya Njambi, kaha Muene ikeye vavenia akashuluka kuhuma muilu. Kaha vaje vatsile mukutsiliela kuli Kilistu vakasangukila ku muono ha kulivanga, <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>ambahoni yetu vaje tucilinakuyoya ha ntsimbu ije vakatukunguluila hamo navo mu mashelua nakuliuana na Muene havukambuila. Kaha tukakala hamo na Muene ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Nankuma, litakameseni umo namukuavo na mezi aua.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Livuaheseleni vualumo ha kuija kua Muene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Vamuanetu, kutuapandele kumisonekela ha vintsimbu na miaka omo viuma evi vikalingiua. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Omuo yeni vavenia muatantekeya ngueni Litangua lia Muene likeja ngue muje muizi akeja vutsiki. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Omo vantu vahandeka nguavo, “Viuma vioshe vili muacili nakuholoka kuluu,” ambahoni hajevene kunonga kukavauana! Hajevene cikeja ngue mushongo ua mpuevo atonda kusema, kaha vantu kuvakasa kuteua. <verse eid="1TH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Vuno honi yeni vamuanetu, kumuesi mu milima, kaha Litangua lije keti likamikasumune ngue muizi. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Yeni voshe muapua vantu vaje vanakundama ku ceke, vaje vanakundama ku mutania. Yetu kutuakundamene ku vutsiki cipue ku milima kuahi. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Nankuma, kutuapandele kukosa tulo ngue veka, tunapande kutona nakulihilula. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Ikapu ntsimbu ya vutsiki omo vantu vakosa tulo, naua ikapu ntsimbu ya vutsiki omo vantu vakapende. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Vuno honi yetu tuakundama ku mutania, kaha tunapande kulihilula. Tunapande kuzala lutsilielo na cizango nge cizalo ca kuliniungisa ha ntulo, nakuzala kutsiliela ca kuovoka kuetu nge tepa. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Njambi katuhanguile kuyandela vutenu vuendi, vuno honi tukatambule kuovoka hali Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>uje uatutsililile linga tukayoye hamo nendi, cipue tuyoya cipue tutsa omo akeja. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Nankuma, tulitakameseni umo na mukuavo nakulikuasa umo na mukuavo, nge muje mumuli nakulinga hano.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vishika via kumanusuluila na vihindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Vamuanetu, tumilomba nguetu haneni kasingimiko kacili kuli vaje vali nakupanga hhakati keni, vaje vamituamenena nakumishika mukuyoya kua vuka Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Pangeni navo nakasingimiko kakama na cizango, omuo ha vipangi vije valinakulinga. Pueni vaka ciyulo hhakati keni.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Vamuanetu, tumisindiya nguetu munangule vilenda, takameseni vipapoke, kuaseni vaka kuzeya, pueni vaka lukakateya kuli uoshe. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Taleni ngeci keti kukale umo ahiluisa vupi ku vupi, vuno honi ntsimbu yoshe pueni vakakulinga muacili kuli umo namukuavo na kuli vantu voshe.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Pueni vaka nzolela ntsimbu yoshe, <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>lombeleni ntsimbu yoshe, <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>ntsatseleni mu viuma vioshe. Eci cikeco catonda Njambi mukuyoya kueni muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Keti muzime Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>keti mukehese mezi a tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Pueni vakakueseka viuma vioshe, kaha niungeni vije vinapu viacili, <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>kaha teueni viuma vioshe via vipi.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Honi Njambi uje mukakutuhana ciyulo amipuise vaka kulela mu vioshe, kaha aniunge vuntu vueni vuoshe, cimbembesi, na muono na muvila, kuakuhona milonga yoshe hakuija ca Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Uje namisana akacilinga, omuo uapua uakulongua.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Vamuanetu, netu tulombeleleni naua.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Hinduiseni voshe vaka kutsiliela nakulitsuemba ca kulela.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Njimilambelela na nzili yakama ya Muene kutanda mukanda ou ku mesho a vaka kutsiliela voshe.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Kavumbi ka Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu kakale hamo neni.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
